<!-- features -->
<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">why pounce</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">One thumb. Every agent. Every machine.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">Built for developers running coding agents across a Mac mini, a laptop, and a studio box — who want to keep things moving without sitting at a desk.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">01 · stream</div><h3>Real-time streaming</h3><p>Watch every agent think and edit live, token by token, exactly as if you were at the terminal.</p></div>
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">02 · voice</div><h3>Hold to talk</h3><p>Press and speak. Pounce transcribes on-device and runs it — navigate, filter, or fire off a new task.</p></div>
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">03 · fleet</div><h3>Multi-device fleet</h3><p>Every machine you pair shows up in one list. Filter by device or agent; jump between them instantly.</p></div>
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">04 · triage</div><h3>“Needs you” first</h3><p>Threads waiting on your input float to the top, so you always know where to look — and nothing stalls.</p></div>
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">05 · anywhere</div><h3>Pair once, reach it anywhere</h3><p>Scan a QR once — even over SSH to a faraway server. Pounce's own secure tunnel finds your machine from any network, no VPN.</p></div>
      <div class="feat reveal"><div class="fn">06 · ship</div><h3>Review &amp; ship</h3><p>See the diff, commit, push, open a PR — finish the job from your phone without breaking flow.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- screens gallery -->
