      <span class="kicker">see it in action</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">The whole loop, in your hand</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">From a glanceable fleet to a live agent thread to a one-tap PR.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery">
      <figure class="shot-fig reveal"><div class="device"><img src="/assets/shot-home.png" alt="Pounce home — all your coding agents across every machine, sorted by what needs you" /></div><figcaption><b>Fleet</b> · one screen</figcaption></figure>
